WEBVTT

00:00.792 --> 00:03.545
Naho, Kiyo, Sumi.

00:05.463 --> 00:08.174
I hope you girls can help me
with my training.

00:08.258 --> 00:11.428
When I'm asleep, if I stop using
Total Concentration Breathing,

00:11.511 --> 00:13.430
can you girls hit me
with these carpet beaters?

00:14.889 --> 00:16.224
I'm begging you.

00:17.809 --> 00:19.144
-Sure, no problem.
-Sure, no problem.

00:19.853 --> 00:21.104
Thank you.

00:32.157 --> 00:33.491
All right, he's fine.

00:33.575 --> 00:35.452
Tanjiro is trying really hard.

00:35.535 --> 00:36.369
Yes!

02:17.971 --> 02:19.556
I'm really useless.

02:19.639 --> 02:21.266
Please help me once more.

02:21.349 --> 02:22.308
-Sure!
-Sure!

02:22.392 --> 02:23.393
Please!

02:23.476 --> 02:24.936
-Good luck!
-Good luck!

02:25.019 --> 02:26.271
I'll succeed this time.

02:34.362 --> 02:36.447
One more time, please!

02:37.407 --> 02:39.409
Are you still the only one here again?

02:39.993 --> 02:41.119
I'm sorry.

02:41.202 --> 02:43.037
I asked them, but…

02:43.121 --> 02:45.415
I don't mind though.

02:46.082 --> 02:48.585
I'll talk to them again later.

02:55.842 --> 02:58.720
Training under the state
of Total Concentration Breathing.

02:58.803 --> 03:00.638
My body has almost gotten used to it.

03:01.139 --> 03:02.974
If I don't push myself harder,

03:03.057 --> 03:05.935
I won't be able to maintain
Total Concentration Breathing all day.

03:07.061 --> 03:10.356
I understand the longer I can maintain
Total Concentration Breathing,

03:10.440 --> 03:12.692
the more my basic physical abilities
will improve!

03:31.002 --> 03:32.462
-You can do it!
-You can do it!

03:43.681 --> 03:45.099
I caught up with her.

03:45.183 --> 03:46.893
I can catch up with her.

03:47.435 --> 03:48.853
I can keep up with her!

04:02.075 --> 04:04.702
That hurts.

04:08.873 --> 04:10.291
Thank you, everyone!

04:17.257 --> 04:19.175
Zenitsu, Inosuke!

04:20.802 --> 04:22.637
I don't care about them anymore.

04:33.815 --> 04:36.734
-You can do it!
-You can do it!

04:45.368 --> 04:47.620
I broke it!

04:49.539 --> 04:52.083
After that, please blow
into this big gourd and break it.

04:52.166 --> 04:53.459
All right.

04:53.543 --> 04:54.877
I did it!

04:54.961 --> 04:56.421
-Amazing.
-I'm almost there.

04:56.504 --> 04:57.672
Thank you, girls!

04:57.755 --> 04:58.756
This is bad.

05:13.021 --> 05:16.149
Tanjiro already went for training.

05:16.232 --> 05:18.484
The sun just came up though.

05:19.986 --> 05:22.280
I am afraid of hard work.

05:22.363 --> 05:25.283
Doing things step by step
is the most tiring thing.

05:27.910 --> 05:28.911
It's you.

05:29.495 --> 05:32.749
Are you worried
because I'm falling behind Tanjiro?

05:32.832 --> 05:36.252
Even if he teaches me slowly,
I still can't remember it.

05:36.836 --> 05:39.547
I think we're really lousy.

05:40.798 --> 05:43.426
Did you say the same thing just now?

05:43.509 --> 05:45.094
Even so, you've gone too far.

05:45.178 --> 05:46.763
"You're trying your best too."

05:46.846 --> 05:48.848
Shouldn't you at least say that to me?

05:50.433 --> 05:52.310
Did you say, "You should work harder"?

05:53.686 --> 05:55.396
It can't be helped then.

06:04.072 --> 06:05.239
It tastes horrible.

06:13.748 --> 06:15.291
Let's go, Monitsu.

06:17.001 --> 06:19.879
What Tanjiro plans to learn

06:19.962 --> 06:22.882
is the technique called
Constant Total Concentration Breathing.

06:23.716 --> 06:27.512
By using Total Concentration Breathing
for the entire day,

06:27.595 --> 06:29.806
your basic physical abilities
will increase drastically.

06:35.978 --> 06:37.772
Let's give it a try now.

06:42.318 --> 06:44.070
No way!

06:44.153 --> 06:45.863
It's impossible!

06:46.572 --> 06:48.157
If I don't push myself harder,

06:48.241 --> 06:51.202
I also can't maintain
Total Concentration Breathing all day.

06:51.285 --> 06:53.746
You two will be fine.

06:53.830 --> 06:56.999
Expand your lungs like this.

06:57.083 --> 07:01.087
When your blood flow is disrupted,
your bones and muscles will clack.

07:01.170 --> 07:02.296
At that moment, maintain it.

07:05.550 --> 07:07.552
After that, it's consistent training.

07:13.015 --> 07:14.225
My goodness.

07:14.308 --> 07:17.520
This is the basic technique.
It's the very first step of the skill.

07:17.603 --> 07:19.439
Learning should be
the second nature to you.

07:19.522 --> 07:22.525
You still need to put in
a lot of effort to master it.

07:29.574 --> 07:32.201
Since learning is second nature to you,

07:33.995 --> 07:36.998
I think Inosuke will master it easily.

07:37.081 --> 07:38.666
Can you do it?

07:38.749 --> 07:41.085
Learning is second nature to you though.

07:41.169 --> 07:43.671
If you can't learn it, then it's fine.

07:43.754 --> 07:45.798
It'd be a shame though.

07:48.843 --> 07:49.927
What?

07:50.011 --> 07:51.262
I'll master it!

07:51.345 --> 07:53.848
Of course I can! Don't look down on me!

07:53.931 --> 07:55.641
Watch out, I'll rip your chest out!

07:57.852 --> 07:59.812
Please do your best, Zenitsu!

07:59.896 --> 08:02.064
I'll cheer for you more than anyone else.

08:02.773 --> 08:06.569
Yes!

08:17.705 --> 08:20.458
Kanao, you got selected with them too.
Why don't you join them?

08:38.142 --> 08:40.978
Keep going! Try harder!

08:41.938 --> 08:43.606
You coward!

08:44.649 --> 08:46.817
You're doing great, Zenitsu!

08:56.077 --> 08:57.578
HEADS

09:22.311 --> 09:23.312
It hurts.

09:24.647 --> 09:26.440
I was so hungry.

09:27.775 --> 09:28.985
Sad days.

09:30.027 --> 09:31.195
Hollow days.

09:32.780 --> 09:33.948
Painful days.

09:35.199 --> 09:36.284
Lonely days.

09:37.994 --> 09:39.662
Those were the days I lived day to day.

09:42.206 --> 09:43.708
Until one day,

09:44.875 --> 09:46.961
a sound rang.

09:52.717 --> 09:55.011
I no longer feel awful.

09:57.471 --> 09:59.557
I won't feel awful again.

10:00.975 --> 10:02.935
Living in poverty,

10:03.436 --> 10:07.523
even when my parents sold me off,
I didn't feel sad.

10:11.319 --> 10:14.238
Excuse me. Can I trouble you for a moment?

10:19.827 --> 10:23.497
Why did you tie this child up?

10:23.581 --> 10:25.541
Is she a criminal or something?

10:25.625 --> 10:26.959
Isn't it obvious to you?

10:27.043 --> 10:29.170
She's so dirty and covered in fleas.

10:29.253 --> 10:31.672
Plus, she might run away.

10:34.091 --> 10:36.302
Nice to meet you.
How are you feeling today?

10:36.927 --> 10:39.013
I'm Kanae Kocho.

10:39.680 --> 10:41.057
What's your name?

10:47.772 --> 10:50.024
This brat doesn't have a name.

10:50.107 --> 10:51.484
Her parents didn't even name her.

10:52.318 --> 10:53.402
Are you done yet?

10:53.486 --> 10:54.570
Move aside.

10:57.156 --> 10:59.116
Please don't touch my older sister.

11:00.451 --> 11:02.244
What did you say, girl?

11:02.328 --> 11:04.872
If you want to talk to this brat, pay up.

11:06.874 --> 11:09.085
Well, I'll buy this child then.

11:09.168 --> 11:10.628
Is this enough?

11:20.554 --> 11:21.764
Don't run away!

11:21.847 --> 11:24.225
You'd better pick up the money now.

11:24.308 --> 11:26.560
There are many people here
and the wind is strong.

11:27.686 --> 11:28.938
Will this be okay?

11:29.021 --> 11:29.939
It's fine.

11:30.022 --> 11:31.774
I'm really sorry.

11:31.857 --> 11:34.485
Don't touch it! It's mine!

11:35.027 --> 11:36.320
My goodness.

11:59.260 --> 12:01.345
Kanae!

12:01.429 --> 12:04.056
Kanae! This child is hopeless.

12:07.017 --> 12:09.061
She won't do anything
unless we told her to.

12:09.145 --> 12:10.563
That includes eating too.

12:10.646 --> 12:13.482
If we don't tell her to eat,
she won't eat at all.

12:13.566 --> 12:15.443
She'd rather starve
until her stomach growls.

12:16.110 --> 12:17.695
My goodness.

12:17.778 --> 12:20.197
If she's like that, what should we do?

12:20.281 --> 12:22.658
Hey, don't get angry.

12:22.741 --> 12:25.453
I really love your smile.

12:26.745 --> 12:30.791
But a child who can't think
and act on her own won't cut it.

12:30.875 --> 12:31.834
It's dangerous.

12:31.917 --> 12:33.878
Well, you're right.

12:33.961 --> 12:35.463
She can't do anything on her own.

12:35.546 --> 12:36.839
She also can't make decisions.

12:37.923 --> 12:42.178
Well, when you're alone,
flip this coin to make a decision.

12:42.261 --> 12:43.929
Do you understand, Kanao?

12:44.013 --> 12:45.598
Kanae!

12:45.681 --> 12:48.559
Don't think too much about it.

12:48.642 --> 12:50.478
Kanao is a super cute child!

12:50.561 --> 12:52.188
That doesn't make sense!

12:52.855 --> 12:56.233
When the time comes,
she will open her heart naturally.

12:56.317 --> 12:57.568
Don't worry.

12:57.651 --> 13:00.029
If she meets a boy she likes one day,

13:00.112 --> 13:02.072
Kanao will probably change.

13:07.077 --> 13:08.996
Great, that's the way!

13:09.663 --> 13:10.539
That's the way!

13:10.623 --> 13:12.541
Heave-ho!

13:12.625 --> 13:13.834
You can do it, Zenitsu!

13:13.918 --> 13:16.378
Keep going! You're doing great.

13:28.849 --> 13:30.768
Inosuke!

13:31.352 --> 13:34.313
Our newly forged Nichirin Blades
are almost here.

13:34.396 --> 13:35.314
Really?

13:35.397 --> 13:37.358
Yes, I heard it from my Kasugai Crow.

13:38.609 --> 13:40.819
I could smell Mr. Haganezuka.

13:42.696 --> 13:44.406
Let's hurry!

13:46.867 --> 13:48.452
Mr. Haganezuka.

13:48.536 --> 13:52.248
Hey! Mr. Haganezuka!

13:54.083 --> 13:56.877
Long time no see!

13:58.712 --> 14:00.548
Have you been well--

14:03.759 --> 14:04.885
Go to hell!

14:05.803 --> 14:07.763
Mr. Haganezuka.

14:08.389 --> 14:11.892
How dare you break my sword!

14:11.976 --> 14:14.270
You've got some nerves!

14:14.353 --> 14:15.437
I'm sorry.

14:15.521 --> 14:16.897
But I really…

14:16.981 --> 14:18.607
At that time, I almost lost my life.

14:18.691 --> 14:20.693
The opponent was very powerful.

14:20.776 --> 14:21.861
Unacceptable!

14:21.944 --> 14:23.279
The opponent is not in the equation.

14:23.362 --> 14:26.240
It was you. It was your mistake.

14:26.323 --> 14:28.868
Because you were too weak.
So, your sword broke.

14:28.951 --> 14:31.495
Otherwise, how could my sword break?

14:31.579 --> 14:32.621
But…

14:32.705 --> 14:34.957
I want to kill you!

14:40.004 --> 14:42.339
Are they doing a new form of training?

14:42.423 --> 14:43.716
I don't think so.

14:46.594 --> 14:50.848
Well, Mr. Haganezuka is such
a hot-tempered person.

14:50.931 --> 14:51.849
Yes.

14:51.932 --> 14:54.476
He appreciates swords
more than anyone else.

14:55.060 --> 14:58.397
In Swordsmith Village,
it's hard to find someone like him.

14:59.189 --> 15:00.357
I think so too.

15:03.235 --> 15:05.195
I'm Kanamori.

15:05.696 --> 15:08.282
I took charge
in forging Lord Inosuke's sword.

15:09.241 --> 15:11.452
It's my honor to do my part in this war.

15:20.461 --> 15:21.962
How beautiful.

15:22.046 --> 15:23.839
The bluish-grey color has a dull shine.

15:23.923 --> 15:25.299
The color has depth to it.

15:25.382 --> 15:27.092
It's an excellent color for swords.

15:27.176 --> 15:28.177
That's great.

15:28.260 --> 15:30.763
Inosuke's original swords
were badly damaged.

15:33.265 --> 15:35.351
How do you feel when you grip them?

15:35.434 --> 15:38.479
Actually, this is my first time
making twin swords

15:38.562 --> 15:39.813
for a dual-wielding swordsman.

15:41.190 --> 15:42.524
Lord Inosuke?

15:53.369 --> 15:56.580
You fool!

15:57.289 --> 15:58.332
Nice!

15:58.874 --> 16:00.834
I want to kill you, you wicked bastard!

16:00.918 --> 16:05.130
-Let me see what you've done!
-I'm sorry.

16:08.759 --> 16:14.139
-Wicked bastard! I won't let you live!
-I'm sorry.

16:14.223 --> 16:15.474
It doesn't make sense, right?

16:15.557 --> 16:16.976
-How can there be such a guy?
-I'm sorry.

16:17.059 --> 16:18.769
-Hammering the sword with a rock?
-I'm sorry.

16:18.852 --> 16:20.729
-It makes no sense!
-I'm sorry.

16:29.363 --> 16:30.739
I think he's doing fine.

16:30.823 --> 16:33.367
Tanjiro has been working hard.

16:33.450 --> 16:35.494
Let's make rice balls for him again.

16:46.588 --> 16:48.632
My body has changed.

16:48.716 --> 16:50.634
I can't wait to swing my sword.

16:50.718 --> 16:53.595
With my hands,
I want to swing the Nichirin Blade.

16:56.724 --> 16:58.767
Yes!

17:02.229 --> 17:04.606
They are equally strong. Good luck!

17:05.983 --> 17:07.443
I mustn't let my guard down!

17:07.526 --> 17:08.819
I can win this!

17:11.905 --> 17:13.490
She missed it!

17:13.991 --> 17:15.826
Watch me!

17:15.909 --> 17:17.661
This concoction smells horrible.

17:17.745 --> 17:19.580
It sucks to be splashed with it.

17:24.626 --> 17:25.961
He won!

17:26.045 --> 17:27.129
Is this considered a win?

17:27.212 --> 17:29.339
Splashing it or putting it on her head
is the same.

17:30.758 --> 17:32.676
Yes! I did it!

17:32.760 --> 17:33.886
-This is bad.
-This is bad.

17:40.809 --> 17:43.562
I'm not going to lose!

17:45.689 --> 17:47.483
Here, open your mouth.

17:51.028 --> 17:53.113
Your jaw looks fine.

17:53.197 --> 17:55.449
Okay, please close your mouth.

17:56.158 --> 17:58.035
That's all for your checkup.

17:58.118 --> 17:59.953
Your body has recovered.

18:00.037 --> 18:02.414
Please be rest assured
and accept your assignments.

18:02.915 --> 18:04.875
Well, the training is…

18:04.958 --> 18:05.834
Yes.

18:05.918 --> 18:08.003
All you have to face
from now on is real combat.

18:08.087 --> 18:09.338
Yes.

18:09.421 --> 18:11.298
Right, Ms. Shinobu.

18:11.381 --> 18:13.425
I have something to ask you.

18:13.509 --> 18:14.635
What is it?

18:15.219 --> 18:18.138
Have you heard of Dance of the Fire God?

18:18.222 --> 18:19.223
No.

18:20.516 --> 18:23.852
What about Breath of the Sun?

18:23.936 --> 18:25.020
No.

18:27.481 --> 18:31.068
Actually, it's something related
to my childhood.

18:31.151 --> 18:32.319
Okay.

18:33.862 --> 18:35.364
I see.

18:35.447 --> 18:39.451
I don't know why your dad
used Breath of the Sun.

18:40.369 --> 18:41.995
From what I know,

18:42.079 --> 18:46.458
there's Breath of Flames,
but not Breath of the Sun.

18:46.542 --> 18:48.669
What? Are they different?

18:49.253 --> 18:51.755
I don't know the details either.

18:51.839 --> 18:53.215
I'm sorry.

18:53.298 --> 18:57.719
There's a strict distinction
to that kind of Breath Styles.

18:57.803 --> 19:01.390
We can't call Breath of Flames
as Breath of the Sun.

19:01.473 --> 19:05.394
The Flame Hashira, Mr. Rengoku,
might know about this.

19:05.477 --> 19:07.813
Unfortunately, he went out on a mission.

19:08.814 --> 19:10.232
I understand.

19:10.315 --> 19:12.901
Thank you for telling me these things.

19:12.985 --> 19:16.238
I'll ask Mr. Rengoku
when I see him next time.

19:16.321 --> 19:17.197
Okay.

19:17.281 --> 19:19.074
Well, I shall take my leave.

19:19.158 --> 19:20.159
Tanjiro.

19:20.242 --> 19:21.118
Yes?

19:22.619 --> 19:24.246
I'm looking forward to your achievements.

19:27.040 --> 19:27.916
Yes!

19:44.766 --> 19:46.560
She's still sleeping today.

19:50.689 --> 19:54.985
Although I heard you're sleeping
to recover your energy,

19:55.694 --> 19:58.780
if you don't open your eyes sometimes,

19:58.864 --> 20:00.240
I'll still get worried.

20:05.787 --> 20:09.833
It's almost time for me to leave
this place and take on missions.

20:10.667 --> 20:12.377
My body has recovered a lot.

20:12.461 --> 20:13.795
I'm slightly stronger too.

20:14.296 --> 20:16.840
I've been maintaining
Constant Total Concentration Breathing.

20:18.175 --> 20:21.261
I believe Zenitsu and Inosuke
will be together with us too.

20:21.970 --> 20:24.139
If they are here, I'll be at ease.

20:27.351 --> 20:28.727
Is that so?

20:28.810 --> 20:30.229
You think so too, Nezuko?

20:31.438 --> 20:32.773
They are great people.

20:33.607 --> 20:35.984
To turn Nezuko back into a human,

20:36.068 --> 20:38.070
I'll try my best to defeat
the stronger demons

20:38.153 --> 20:40.572
and deliver their blood to Ms. Tamayo.

20:41.573 --> 20:43.867
Can I really do it?

20:44.910 --> 20:46.870
You can definitely do it, Tanjiro.

20:56.546 --> 20:57.881
Thank you, Nezuko.

20:57.965 --> 20:59.925
You're cheering me on, aren't you?

21:00.008 --> 21:01.969
I'll do my best.

22:52.913 --> 22:55.624
It's so tiring to maintain
Total Concentration Breathing.

22:55.707 --> 22:57.542
I can't master it at all. Damn it.

22:58.126 --> 23:00.212
You guys must be tired.

23:00.295 --> 23:01.213
Right!

23:01.296 --> 23:04.049
I know a little gossip
from the Taisho era.

23:04.132 --> 23:07.219
If you pour the concoction
during reflex training into your bath,

23:07.302 --> 23:10.889
I heard it's great for eliminating fatigue
and promoting wound healing.

23:10.972 --> 23:12.390
I'm going to train now.

23:12.474 --> 23:14.142
You two should take a break.

23:14.726 --> 23:16.686
I can still continue!
Don't look down on me!

23:16.770 --> 23:18.563
Are we still training?

23:18.647 --> 23:21.233
All right. Fine! I'll go!

23:21.316 --> 23:24.194
Next, episode 26, "New Mission."

23:24.277 --> 23:26.154
I'll be going then, Nezuko.

23:27.489 --> 23:28.657
TO BE CONTINUED

23:28.740 --> 23:30.075
Subtitle translation by Michelle Chai
